"""
nsx-toolkit.py v2.1 -- NSX Zero Trust Segmentation Toolkit

Single-file, self-contained. Only dependency: 'requests'.

    py nsx-toolkit.py                -> interactive menu
    py nsx-toolkit.py --help         -> non-interactive flags
    py nsx-toolkit.py --version      -> version string
    py nsx-toolkit.py --dashboard    -> compliance posture dashboard

DESIGN NOTES
  - API CONTRACT: every path, parameter and field is declared once at the
    top. A future NSX release changes ONE variable, not every function.
  - Credentials resolve BEFORE the menu.
  - Scope follows the action: tag ops = LMs only; group/rule ops = GM+LMs.
  - Writes are audit-logged with before/after state and undo.
  - Every result exportable to CSV or JSON.
  - Color output with Windows ANSI detection and --no-color fallback.
"""

